{"text": "Jack and his mother were very poor, so Jack took their cow to sell. But he swapped her for five magic beans! His mother was very angry, and she threw the beans out of the window. The next morning, a giant beanstalk stood in the garden, up to the clouds! Jack climbed higher and higher, above the fields and the clouds. At the top, in a giant's castle, he found a hen that laid golden eggs. Jack ran home with the hen and cut down the beanstalk. Now they were never poor again!", "words": [[0.54, 0.76], [0.82, 0.88], [0.9, 1.02], [1.08, 1.3], [1.36, 1.48], [1.5, 1.7], [1.78, 2.04], [2.36, 2.44], [2.56, 2.78], [2.88, 3.02], [3.08, 3.22], [3.26, 3.46], [3.52, 3.58], [3.66, 3.92], [4.42, 4.5], [4.54, 4.58], [4.68, 4.98], [5.0, 5.08], [5.12, 5.22], [5.32, 5.64], [5.68, 5.96], [6.04, 6.48], [8.04, 8.16], [8.22, 8.44], [8.48, 8.6], [8.68, 8.88], [9.02, 9.32], [9.68, 9.78], [9.82, 9.9], [9.98, 10.14], [10.18, 10.24], [10.28, 10.64], [10.72, 10.86], [10.88, 10.92], [10.94, 11.02], [11.04, 11.36], [12.84, 12.92], [12.96, 13.22], [13.28, 13.62], [13.78, 13.81], [13.9, 14.26], [14.3, 14.86], [14.94, 15.12], [15.16, 15.2], [15.24, 15.3], [15.34, 15.7], [16.08, 16.16], [16.24, 16.3], [16.34, 16.4], [16.44, 16.96], [18.52, 18.74], [18.82, 19.14], [19.22, 19.48], [19.52, 19.62], [19.68, 19.96], [20.26, 20.5], [20.52, 20.6], [20.66, 21.04], [21.08, 21.16], [21.18, 21.24], [21.28, 21.78], [23.32, 23.4], [23.42, 23.5], [23.56, 23.8], [23.98, 24.04], [24.06, 24.09], [24.18, 24.56], [24.62, 25.12], [25.5, 25.54], [25.62, 25.84], [25.88, 25.91], [25.96, 26.16], [26.24, 26.36], [26.42, 26.62], [26.72, 27.08], [27.2, 27.5], [29.08, 29.3], [29.4, 29.56], [29.68, 29.9], [29.94, 30.04], [30.06, 30.12], [30.18, 30.4], [30.58, 30.68], [30.72, 30.9], [30.96, 31.12], [31.16, 31.22], [31.26, 31.92], [32.46, 32.62], [32.68, 32.78], [32.82, 32.94], [32.98, 33.16], [33.22, 33.44], [33.48, 33.911]], "scenes": [0.0, 7.52, 12.38, 17.98, 22.82, 28.54], "tag": "kokoro:bm_fable", "fx": "pb1", "aligned